decider-mlx
===========

Unofficial Apple Silicon runtime adaptation for Mapika Decider.
This project does not train a new model and is not affiliated with or endorsed
by Mapika, Alibaba/Qwen, or Apple.

Upstream model and decision semantics:
  Mapika/decider — https://github.com/Mapika/decider
  Audited prompt/readout revision: b44b4c9880a67291206499b86aac89004850134a
  The packaged loader verifies exact prompt.py/systemone.py SHA-256 values.
  Apache License 2.0; see LICENSE.
  Model: https://huggingface.co/Mapika/decider-4b
  Tested v1 revision: c23ab4d2483e7c6a93484463e9afe1688b29bedd
  Model/base-model licenses and attribution apply separately to downloaded weights.

MLX runtime and recurrent-kernel basis:
  mlx-lm — https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-lm
  Tested package version: 0.31.3
  Copyright © 2023 Apple Inc.
  MIT License; full text retained in licenses/MLX-LM-MIT.txt.
  The packed gated-delta implementation is a modified specialization of the
  MLX-LM recurrent implementation; it is not claimed as an original model.

Modifications in this distribution include local FP16 streaming conversion,
explicit model/source configuration, native typed-answer integration,
within-request prefix reuse, packed recurrent dispatch, packaging and tests.
Floating-point/backend changes can change outputs. No universal numerical
identity or full stock-versus-ported 4B speedup is claimed.

No checkpoint weights, private experiment inputs, or personal logs are bundled.
